---
import { Code } from "astro/components";
---

<section class="lg:col-span-3">
  <h2 class="mb-3 px-1 text-sm font-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="card boxed-list">
    <details class="group">
      <summary
        class="hover:bg-shade flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4 text-left font-medium"
      >
        <span>Installation fails with a dependency error. What do I do?</span>
        <span
          class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] dim-label shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
        ></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="dim-label px-4 pb-4 text-sm">
        A library from the requirements list is missing. Building from source
        needs every listed library, including the Astal modules; only the River
        and Hyprland Astal modules are optional.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group">
      <summary
        class="hover:bg-shade flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4 text-left font-medium"
      >
        <span>How can I have the bar at the top?</span>
        <span
          class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] dim-label shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
        ></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm">
        <p>
          Either run{" "}
          <Code
            code={`gsettings set com.arkye.morghulis navbar-anchor "top"`}
            lang="sh"
            inline
          />{" "}
          or change it in the Quick Menu, then reload Morghulis.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group">
      <summary
        class="hover:bg-shade flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4 text-left font-medium"
      >
        <span>Brightness controls or the brightness OSD do nothing.</span>
        <span
          class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] dim-label shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
        ></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="dim-label px-4 pb-4 text-sm">
        Your user must be in the <code>video</code> group to use backlight services,
        and the OSD only shows when your keybinding also runs{" "}
        <code>morghulis -r change_brightness</code>.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="group">
      <summary
        class="hover:bg-shade flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 p-4 text-left font-medium"
      >
        <span>Does Morghulis work with NVIDIA proprietary drivers?</span>
        <span
          class="icon-[lucide--chevron-down] dim-label shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
        ></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="dim-label px-4 pb-4 text-sm">
        Yes, Morghulis is compatible with NVIDIA proprietary drivers. Make sure
        you're running the latest driver version for the best experience. Some
        Wayland-specific features may require driver version 495 or newer.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
